OL,3,GNEWSA'He used to come home covered in
OL,4,Aasbestos - his death was very quick'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWithin three months of being diagnosed
OL,7,Fwith asbestos-related lung cancer,
OL,8,FMelvin Emms had died. His family, like
OL,9,Fhundreds of others in a Wiltshire town
OL,10,Frenowned for its railway works, say
OL,11,Fthey are shocked by the speed at which
OL,12,Fthe disease claimed their loved one's
OL,13,Flife.
OL,15,FLiz Emms, from Swindon, said it was
OL,16,Fawful watching her husband's rapid
OL,17,Fdeterioration in 2024. But the bereaved
OL,18,Fwife is not alone in her grief.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
