OL,3,GNEWSA'He used to come home covered in
OL,4,Aasbestos - his death was very quick'
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe is surrounded by other widows who
OL,7,Fhave also lost loved ones to
OL,8,Fasbestos-related cancers, in a town
OL,9,Fwhere residents refer to mesothelioma
OL,10,Fas the "Swindon disease".
OL,12,FDozens of bereaved families have now
OL,13,Funited for a special memorial event to
OL,14,Fpay tribute to their relatives and
OL,15,Fhighlight the impact of the disease.
